{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30402","headline":"杜陵贻杜牧侍御 · 赵嘏","name":"杜陵贻杜牧侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫陌尘多不可寻，南溪酒熟一披襟。\n山高昼枕石牀隐，泉落夜窗烟树深。\n白首寻人嗟问计，青云无路觅知音。\n唯君怀抱安如水，他日门墙许醉吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30402.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30402","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}